					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "MODE\n\nThe mode node calculate the mode of a given collection. The mode is the most common value in a data set. This is node is related to other averages like Average and Median.\n\nIn this example we create 10 rings with a random size at 10 random positions uppon a trigger (trigger away to see the change). We added smooths because it looks cool.\n\nThe Random - Size collection is used to generate a random size for each circle. We also calculate the Mode, Median and Average of this collection.\nThese are displayed in red."
					}
				},
